      "translation": "创建一个 <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 包中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>，其单位为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 包中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> with the given unix timestamp and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个带有给定 Unix 时间戳和<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>的新<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain an <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> that indicates to keep the existing one, e.g. when sending a <code>SET</code> command.",
      "translation": "获取一个<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>，表示保留现有的值，例如在发送<code>SET</code>命令时。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建新的<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 包中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a new persistent, non-expiring <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的持久化且不过期的<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>precision</code> - time precision. Must be <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>for EX</code></a> or <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>for PX</code></a>\n         operations.",
      "translation": "<code>precision</code> - 时间精度。对于 <code>EX</code> 或 <code>PX</code> 操作，必须为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a> 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expirationTime</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>length of time</code></a> for expiration.",
      "translation": "<code>expirationTime</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>过期时长</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Durations with at least seconds resolution uses <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>. <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Durations</code></a> in\nmilliseconds use <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a>.",
      "translation": "具有至少秒级分辨率的持续时间使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>。<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/time/Duration.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.time\"><code>Durations</code></a> 以毫秒为单位时使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
