    {
      "source": "<strong>NOTE: </strong>Please follow the documentation for the individual commands to see if keeping the existing\nTTL is applicable.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong>请查阅各命令的文档，以确认保留现有 TTL 是否适用。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> with the provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>. Greater units than <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a> are\nconverted to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>. Units smaller than <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a> are converted to\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a> and can lose precision since <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a> is the smallest\ngranularity supported by Redis.",
      "translation": "创建新的 <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>，使用提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>。大于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a> 的单位将转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>。小于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a> 的单位将转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a>，并可能丢失精度，因为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#MILLISECONDS\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit.MILLISECONDS</code></a> 是 Redis 支持的最小粒度。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> holds a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>numeric value</code></a> with an associated <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a> 包含一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>数值</code></a>，并关联有一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> with the provided <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建新的<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.types 中的类\"><code>Expiration</code></a>，使用提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"java.util.concurrent 中的类或接口\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeUnit</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a> used to measure the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>expiration time</code></a>; can be null.\n         Defaulted to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>",
      "translation": "<code>timeUnit</code> - 用于测量<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>过期时间</code></a>；可为 null。\n默认为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "a new <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a> configured with the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>length of time</code></a> in <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一个使用给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a> 中的<a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>length of time</code></a>（时长）进行配置的新的 <a href=\"Expiration.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.types\"><code>Expiration</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expirationTime</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>length of time</code></a> for expiration. Defaulted to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>expirationTime</code> - 过期时长，类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>length of time</code></a>。默认值为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html#SECONDS\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit.SECONDS</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>timeUnit</code> - <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a> used to measure <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>expirationTime</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<code>timeUnit</code> - 用于测量 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/concurrent/TimeUnit.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util.concurrent\"><code>TimeUnit</code></a> 的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Long.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>expirationTime</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
